    <sys:String x:Key="S.Control.RecordWaiting">Recording starts in {0} s… (press to cancel)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Control.RecordWaitCalib">Recording waits for calibration: stand still… (press to cancel)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Control.RecordRunning">⏺  Recording… {0} s (press to finish)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Control.RecordTip">To measure and improve tracking with your real movement: press, put the headset on within 15 s and step in front of the camera. Once calibrated, two beeps start the recording; for 60 s walk, turn, sit and stand, take steps. A high beep ends it. It is written to logs
ecordings and sent nowhere.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Control.Hint">Calibration happens by itself: wear the headset, stand straight in front of the camera, look ahead and hold still for 2 s (two short beeps, then a high one). To redo it, hold both hands above your head for 2 s or press the key. Shoulders to feet must be in view; the head may be out of the picture.</sys:String>

